sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant B as Blazor App
    participant Auth as Auth Middleware
    participant CV as Computer Vision
    participant GPT as Azure OpenAI GPT-4.1-nano
    participant G as Google Gemini
    participant TS as Table Storage

    Note over U,TS: Authentication Flow

    U->>B: GET /login or /challenge-microsoft
    alt Dev Environment (no AzureAd:ClientId)
        B->>Auth: TestAuthHandler (cookie-only)
        Auth-->>B: Set dev cookie (fake identity)
    else Production
        B->>Auth: OIDC challenge → Entra ID
        Auth-->>B: JWT validated → session cookie issued
    end
    B-->>U: 302 Redirect → Home

    Note over U,TS: Image Analysis and Regeneration Flow

    U->>B: Upload image JPEG or PNG (base64)
    B->>B: Validate magic bytes (FF D8 or 89 50 4E 47)
    B->>CV: AnalyzeImageAsync(bytes)
    CV-->>B: description + tags[] + confidence float
    B->>GPT: EnhanceDescriptionAsync(raw description)
    GPT-->>B: Refined 200-500 char creative prompt

    alt Mode = Regenerate
        B->>G: GenerateImageAsync(prompt, referenceBytes)
        G-->>B: PNG bytes (gemini-2.5-flash-image)
    else Mode = Meme
        B->>B: MemeGeneratorService overlay caption on image
    else Mode = Analyze only
        B->>B: Return description and tags only
    end

    B-->>U: ImageAnalysisResult (base64 + metrics + tags)

    Note over U,TS: Bulk Generate Flow

    U->>B: Submit prompt text + art style count
    B->>TS: INSERT BulkPrompt (Status=Pending)
    B->>TS: UPDATE BulkPrompt (Status=Processing)

    loop 10 art styles in parallel (Task.WhenAll)
        B->>G: GenerateImageAsync(style + prompt)
        G-->>B: PNG bytes per style
        B->>TS: INSERT ImageResult (index, imageUrl, generationMs)
        B->>B: StateHasChanged() → live progress update
    end

    B->>TS: UPDATE BulkPrompt (Status=Complete)
    B-->>U: All 10 images rendered via Blazor Server SignalR
